<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">All financial information is presented on the basis of International
Financial Reporting Standards (&ldquo;IFRS&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Sony Group Corporation and its consolidated subsidiaries are together
referred to as &ldquo;Sony&rdquo; or &ldquo;Sony Group.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Sony has adopted IFRS 17 &ldquo;Insurance Contracts&rdquo;
(&ldquo;IFRS 17&rdquo;) starting in the three months ended June 30, 2023. Figures for the three months ended March 31, 2023 and for the
fiscal year ended March 31, 2023, as well as the consolidated statement of financial position as of April 1, 2022, are restated in accordance
with IFRS 17. Please refer to &ldquo;Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements - Accounting Policy and Other Information (Changes in
accounting policies)&rdquo; on page F-20 for more details.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>


